@host = http://localhost:5292

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Search books
GET {{host}}/api/books?search=dune&page=1&pageSize=10

### Genres
GET {{host}}/api/genres

### Create user (temporary, until auth is added)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reader@example.com",
  "displayName": "Reader"
}

### Record interactions (replace ids)
POST {{host}}/api/interactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    {
      "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "sessionId": "session-1",
      "bookId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "type": "Purchase"
    }
  ]
}

### Popular books (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/api/recommendations/popular?count=5

### Personalized recommendations (replace id)
GET {{host}}/api/recommendations/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000?count=10

### Similar books (replace id)
GET {{host}}/api/recommendations/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/similar?count=5
